  "behaviour": [
    "Link form: https://<site>/w/<readable>-<4 random>, e.g. /w/aisha-k7q2. Random part from a 31-character alphabet without look-alikes (no 0, o, 1, l, i); unique across all wishes.",
    "What the link returns, by state, decided only from server time and the wish row: draft or unpaid -> gone (404 'not_here'); sealed and before opensAt -> countdown with opensAt and serverTime (no content); sealed with passcode or question and time reached -> passcode or question (no content, no answer); open -> content; resting -> seal, 'This wish is resting. Wake it.' and keep offer; deleted, erased or taken down -> gone.",
    "Content and secret answers never leave the server before the wish may open (T-72, T-74). The phone's clock is never read.",
    "Every wish opens at midnight in the receiver's time zone unless the sender chose 'open now' (T-72).",
    "Wrong passcode or answer attempts are limited per link and per IP.",
    "Links are excluded from search engines (X-Robots-Tag: noindex) (T-74).",
    "Replaces STUB-9 (/w/mine?id=<local id>), STUB-10 and STUB-21."
  ],
